      "text": "Fig. 9, ‘Status of data availability for key HWF topics’ (Source: WHO National Health Workforce Accounts, 2025). A horizontal bar chart ranking ten health workforce topics by the number and percentage of WHO Member States reporting data for at least one occupation: Stock (194, 100%), Sex (189, 97%), Activity level (183, 94%), Age group (174, 90%), Graduates (167, 86%), Place of training (139, 72%), Facility ownership (137, 71%), Place of birth (134, 69%), Facility type (131, 68%), and Subnational distribution (85, 44%).",
